      <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="Organizational-Person-registeredAddress-doc">
        <body>Registered-Address - Specifies a mnemonic for an address associated with an object at a particular city location. The mnemonic is registered in the country/region in which the city is located and is used in the provision of the Public Telegram Service. (LDAP-Syntax: Object(Replica-Link))</body>
      </ownedComment>
