      <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="User-mSMQSignCertificatesMig-doc">
        <body>MSMQ-Sign-Certificates-Mig - In MSMQ mixed-mode, the attribute contains the previous value of mSMQSignCertificates. MSMQ supports migration from the MSMQ 1.0 DS to the Windows 2000 DS, and mixed mode specifies a state in which some of the DS severs were not upgraded to Windows 2000. (LDAP-Syntax: Object(Replica-Link))</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" value="0"/>
      <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" value="1"/>
